Crafted from solid brass, this adjustable height floor standing makeup mirror is made to stay steady, with a heavy solid brass base designed to help prevent tipping. A felt pad under the base helps prevent scratching on the surface beneath it. The freestanding design lets this standing mirror set up where you need it—no wall mounting required. Traditional styling with classic accents keeps the look timeless, and it’s available in a wide variety of lifetime designer finishes for easy coordination. Assembly is required. Includes one make-up mirror.

